# Baseline ignores — installed once at repo root (INSTALL.md §1).
# Covers ordinary tool/interpreter caches, not generated deliverables.
# Add this repo's generated-deliverable globs below (practice `generated-artifact-provenance`) instead of
# replacing this file — merge into an existing .gitignore if one is present.

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Written at session start by tools/precedent_session_practices.py: the
# practices in force from the TEAM and INDIVIDUAL sources. Untracked on
# purpose and not negotiable. In a PUBLIC repo that text is private and
# committing it would publish every private practice in one file, on the
# commit that added the convenience. In a private repo it is still derived,
# regenerated per session, and has no business in history.
#
# This repo's own .gitignore has carried this rule since the channel
# existed; the template shipped to adopters did not, so every install from
# it got the channel without the guard (found 2026-09-07, in a real public
# consumer).
.precedent/
